title: "VoltPulse: China Power Spot Market Dynamics & BESS Optimal Dispatch Analytics Platform"
abstract: "A high-performance, modular analytics and optimization platform for China electricity spot markets (Shandong/Shanxi), featuring HiGHS MILP battery energy storage arbitrage, duck curve negative price mitigation, and an 8-dimensional automated data quality gate."
